Calm textured artwork of cream linen (#F4EDE0) with a large soft golden circular glow rising from the upper right like a gentle halo, its warm honey light fading into the fabric. Delicate red (#C8372D) cross-stitch star motifs are sparsely placed along the bottom border, with subtle grain and dreamy diffused atmosphere. The upper 30% stays soft and quiet for text. 8K quality, ultra smooth gradients, premium feel, no text, no letters, no UI elements, no device mockups